回药碗基线未尽药不能自动成为后场局部入口；需独立确认是否始终同碗未动。","terminal_object: 必须同时守住未尽药与冷两种末端义务；冷药请求未执行，但种子级状态/温度转换仍未知。"]},"participants":["baoyu","zijuan"],"required_beats":[{"citations":[{"byte_range":[15574,15819],"lines":[409,411],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6294a4b92d26277a59da7e8bc02363262507446bc5fe5720ddeb32b03006fb46"},{"byte_range":[15819,15973],"lines":[412,414],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e34ce345aab8ce8482fb7b5f85e293931a8b3995005ad570602acbb4a69621e0"},{"byte_range":[16984,17170],"lines":[436,438],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"35c6a9a0cdd9c2ba9f86db12541717d70b9d68b1e86bd65d6a9c6e1f024dcd09"},{"byte_range":[17170,17286],"lines":[439,441],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6d15feb53097e6205fe066b2c72adcdc0766ade8d867826e11f4f329e94c9ec9"}],"description":"实际到场后宝玉面对仍未吃完的药，只问“药还没吃么？再温一温”；问药是请求，不是温药执行，也不证明到场前已知确切死时。到场后获知与问话的精确相位仍待场级核定。","epistemic":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT"},{"citations":[{"byte_range":[15574,15819],"lines":[409,411],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6294a4b92d26277a59da7e8bc02363262507446bc5fe5720ddeb32b03006fb46"},{"byte_range":[16984,17170],"lines":[436,438],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"35c6a9a0cdd9c2ba9f86db12541717d70b9d68b1e86bd65d6a9c6e1f024dcd09"},{"byte