边界未核定。","entry_checkpoint: 86-S6为后续局部场；显式前驱仅依SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY声明，不继承上一场状态。","event_bindings: 现有世界事件是章节粗粒度模型，未证明本种子的场级时点；event_refs保持空，不把声明当状态依据。","exit_state: 所列本场出口目标均缺少独立场级世界/对象/知识检查点，value保持null、status为UNKNOWN。","entry_state.object.OBJ-MEDICINE-BOWL-86.temperature: OT86-01支持本回药转冷，但种子抵达时的具体转冷检查点仍未绑定。","entry_state.character.baoyu.knowledge.daiyu_death_exact_moment: 到达与获知先后尚未映射到86-S6；不可把K86到达后更新当入口已知。","preconditions.object.OBJ-MEDICINE-BOWL-86.status: 全回药碗基线未尽药不能自动成为后场局部入口；需独立确认是否始终同碗未动。","terminal_object: 必须同时守住未尽药与冷两种末端义务；冷药请求未执行，但种子级状态/温度转换仍未知。"]},"participants":["baoyu","zijuan"],"required_beats":[{"citations":[{"byte_range":[15574,15819],"lines":[409,411],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6294a4b92d26277a59da7e8bc02363262507446bc5fe5720ddeb32b03006fb46"},{"byte_range":[15819,15973],"lines":[412,414],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e34ce345aab8ce8482fb7b5f85e293931a8b3995005ad570602acbb4a69621e0"},{"byte_range":[16984,17170],"lines":[436,438],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"35c6a9a0cdd9c2ba9f86db12541717d70b9d68b1e86bd65d6a9c6e1f024dcd09"},{"byte_range":[17170,17286],"lines":[439,441],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6d15feb53097e6205fe066b2c72adcdc0766ade8d867826e11f4f329e94c9ec9"}],"description":"实际到场后宝玉面对仍未吃完的药，只问“药还没吃么？再温一温”；问药是请求，不是温药执行，也不证明到场前已知确切死时。到场后获知与问话的精确相位仍待场级核定。","epistemic":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT"},{"citations":[{"byte_range":[15574,15819],"lines":[409,411],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6294a4b92d26277a59da7e8bc02363262507446bc5fe5720ddeb32b03006fb46"},{"byte_range":[16984,17170],"lines":[436,438],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"35c6a9a0cdd9c2ba9f86db12541717d70b9d68b1e86bd65d6a9c6e1f024dcd09"},{"byte_range":[17170,17286],"lines":[439,441],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6d15feb53097e6205fe066b2c72adcdc0766ade8d867826e11f4f329e94c9ec9"},{"byte_range":[17700,18079],"lines":[454,457],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"ca835b9c0cc0faa57e527da203559a9747367ae96a4fd542615428deec253849"}],"description":"药吊子与熄去的炉火保留照护留下的物理痕迹；药仍未尽，无人落实宝玉再温的请求，紫鹃不翻稿。冷药保持为结尾实物，不因一个祈使句转成温热或已服完。","epistemic":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT"},{"citations":[{"byte_range":[17170,17286],"lines":[439,441],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"6d15feb53097e6205fe066b2c72adcdc0766ade8d867826e11f4f329e94c9ec9"},{"byte_range":[17286,17433],"lines":[442,444],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"ce0fb459938c863d8d51711a9daa666372f309271941913db29597c3e6367ae3"},{"byte_range":[17660,17700],"lines":[452,453],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"44e50474767c8d9301ed3c5c77ae2942e439a0cef17b919c728501c816f9af53"},{"byte_range":[17700,18079],"lines":[454,457],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"ca835b9c0cc0faa57e527da203559a9747367ae96a4fd542615428deec253849"}],"description":"结尾停在冷药这一物理事实，以散文收，不追加作者诗、解释性象征或总结性哭声。","epistemic":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT"}],"required_objects":["OBJ-MEDICINE-BOWL-86","local:ch86:stove-fire"],"revision":"v3","scope":"EDITORIAL_MODEL_ONLY_NOT_OBSERVED","status":"UNREVIEWED_EDITORIAL_MODEL","temporal_rule":"CAUSAL_DAG_NOT_SEED_LIST_ORDER","version":1},"path":"data/writing/local-scenarios/ch86-v1/contracts/86-S6.v3.json","unresolved":"LOCAL_EDITORIAL_MODEL_NOT_OBSERVED_OR_TEXT_VERIFIED"}],"sources":[{"record":{"bibliography":{"citation":"北京市文物局《寺院土地田产的经营方式（中）》所录“乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契”","url":"https://wwj.beijing.gov.cn/bjww/wwjzzcslm/1731063/1731066/djs/1731072/1731538/index.html"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76","sha256":"fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc","sha256":"15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc"},"excerpt_revision":{"previous_source_sha256":"fb2845103abef44f85900f24c064d3139ae138b63837902f9f68727aaf817235","ref":"asset:sha256:e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c","sha256":"e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c"},"id":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract","legacy_locator":{"contract":"乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契","region":"今北京昌平一带"},"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:e0953b78c0d81651b56b799c02495d66c4dc5429578cffc85569b259e53e86f4","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"44977b3557cf6ec3d400a1311f98bf03ac97b4331cd00f0293511a7c5380110d","raw_text_sha256":"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":3879,"start":3760,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"locator_verification":{"reason":"Revised raw excerpt verified; correction and claim impact are recorded separately.","report_ref":"asset:sha256:0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","report_sha256":"0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","source_record_sha256":"d75e42caf94a7e3018466178aa019c7cd6dfef5d8c7a5b8aaacb7737d5426ec0","status":"VERIFIED"},"notes":"证明乾隆北京地区存在正式房屋租契与租价约定；该契为铺面房，不能证明贾家具体住宅院落或租价。","text":"立租契人系瑞应寺下院当家宗玉，今有二拔子庙上铺面房屋一所，共计十六间，今租沙河德春店作理生意，连借缸三口。对众言定每年租价清钱五十千正，只许客辞主，不许主辞客。房屋损坏，房主修理。恐后无凭，立租帖存照。现收租价清钱三十千正。租价不许增长。","text_sha256":"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4","title":"乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"北京市文物局页面录文；乾隆三十九年六月初六日","label":"大觉寺藏清代契约文书","siglum":"BJ-RENT-1774"}},"verification":{"asset":{"asset_id":"asset:sha256:15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc","bytes":37389,"path":"sources/primary/received/15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc/rental.html","sha256":"15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc"},"declared_locator_verification":{"reason":"Revised raw excerpt verified; correction and claim impact are recorded separately.","report_ref":"asset:sha256:0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","report_sha256":"0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","source_record_sha256":"d75e42caf94a7e3018466178aa019c7cd6dfef5d8c7a5b8aaacb7737d5426ec0","status":"VERIFIED"},"excerpt_revision":{"previous_source_sha256":"fb2845103abef44f85900f24c064d3139ae138b63837902f9f68727aaf817235","ref":"asset:sha256:e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c","sha256":"e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c","status":"PASS"},"findings":[],"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:e0953b78